@startuml
' Lecturer Support Agent — editable PlantUML source
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
title Head of Department Assigns Course
actor "Head of Department" as HOD
participant UI
participant Authorization as Auth
participant "Course Assignment Service" as Course
participant Notification
participant Audit
HOD -> UI : Assign course/module to lecturer
UI -> Auth : verify HOD and department scope
Auth --> UI : allowed/denied
UI -> Course : create assignment with period/workload
Course -> Course : validate course, lecturer, conflicts and dates
Course -> Audit : record assignment
Course -> Notification : notify lecturer/coordinator
Course --> UI : result and warnings
@enduml
